.TH FONT-INSTALLER-GUI 1 "2026-11-17" "instalador-de-fontes 1.1.1" "Mainuan"
.SH NAME
font-installer-gui \- preview and install a font file for the current user
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B font-installer-gui
.I font-file
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B font-installer-gui
reads the font file with
.BR fc-scan (1)
and shows, in a
.BR yad (1)
window, a sample text rendered in that font together with its name,
style, type, family and foundry.
.PP
When
.B Install
is chosen, the file is copied to
.I ~/.local/share/fonts
and the font cache is rebuilt with
.BR fc-cache (1).
Nothing is written outside the user's home directory and no
administrator rights are needed.
.PP
TrueType, OpenType, WOFF and WOFF2 files are offered by the file manager
through the desktop entry
.IR font-installer.desktop .
.SH EXIT STATUS
.B 0
when the font was installed or the window was closed;
.B 1
when no existing file was given or the file is not a font.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
The interface follows
.BR LANGUAGE ,
.BR LC_ALL ,
.BR LC_MESSAGES " and " LANG .
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/fonts
Destination of the installed fonts.
.SH EXAMPLE
font-installer-gui ~/Downloads/NotoSans-Regular.ttf
